From: EasyStick maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] cfg80211: retain the wireless_dev netdev link

The Linux 6.18 cfg80211 registration helper requires
net_device::ieee80211_ptr to point at the wireless_dev.  Keep the link that
the ESP-Hosted source already initializes; the subsequent EasyStick patch
uses cfg80211_register_netdevice() to publish it to nl80211.

---
 esp_cfg80211.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/esp_cfg80211.c b/esp_cfg80211.c
--- a/esp_cfg80211.c
+++ b/esp_cfg80211.c
@@ -305,1 +305,2 @@
+	/* Keep the wireless_dev link required by cfg80211 netdev registration. */
 	ndev->ieee80211_ptr = &esp_wdev->wdev;
-- 
